    "message": "Package DataStandardizer.UNM49 has been replaced by package DataStandardizer.Geography.  Future fixes and enhancements will be incorporated into DataStandardizer.Geography only.  All users of DataStandardizer.UNM49 are encouraged to migrate to DataStandardizer.Geography at their earliest convenience.",
